{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107402","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107402/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107402/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107402/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107402","id":3136574614,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6aBQlc","number":107402,"title":"Stop `FileAccess::fix_path` from emitting errors for invalid UIDs","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-06-11T12:02:37Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T09:00:14Z","closed_at":"2025-06-12T21:48:54Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107402","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107402","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107402.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107402.patch","merged_at":"2025-06-12T21:48:54Z"},"body":"Fixes #101962.\r\n\r\nThis is mostly a quick hack to prompt a discussion about a more proper fix, and maybe serve as a hold-over, but...\r\n\r\nThis adds a `ResourceUID::has_id` check to `FileAccess::fix_path`, before it tries to call `ResourceUID::text_to_id`, and instead just clears the output string if it's not a known UID, same as what this error check is already doing inadvertently by returning an empty `String` when it can't find the UID:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/51b0379e5502402d44818a4b6f301f544a5754f3/core/io/resource_uid.cpp#L199\r\n\r\nWithout this, you could otherwise pass perfectly reasonable (or not) but non-existent `uid://` paths to `FileAccess::fix_path` and it would emit the above mentioned error about `Unrecognized UID`, which is exactly what happens in places like the LSP server, where it runs every string literal in the GDScript file through `FileAccess::file_exists`, which in turn calls `FileAccess::fix_path`, as seen here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/51b0379e5502402d44818a4b6f301f544a5754f3/modules/gdscript/language_server/gdscript_extend_parser.cpp#L207-L214\r\n\r\nI feel like the proper fix is to change `FileAccess::fix_path` to instead return a `bool`, to indicate a failure to fix/resolve the path, like when trying to fix/resolve a non-existent UID, but since that would/should require changing quite a lot of call sites I settled for this for now.\r\n\r\nThe fact that the LSP server is running every GDScript string literal through `FileAccess::file_exists` is maybe a bit questionable as well, but that seems like more of a performance concern than anything else. `FileAccess::file_exists` should not throw errors on non-existent UIDs.","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107402/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107402/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}